{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43245","headline":"日华川上动 · 石殷士","name":"日华川上动","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曙霞攒旭日，浮景弄晴川。\n晃曜层潭上，悠扬极浦前。\n岸高时拥媚，波远渐澄鲜。\n萍实空随浪，珠胎不照渊。\n早暄依曲渚，微动触轻涟。\n孰假咸池望，幽情得古篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"石殷士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}